1,1S19.45,13,20,13z M11,2v2c0,0.55,0.45,1,1,1s1-0.45,1-1V2c0-0.55-0.45-1-1-1S11,1.45,11,2z M11,20v2c0,0.55,0.45,1,1,1s1-0.45,1-1v-2c0-0.55-0.45-1-1-1C11.45,19,11,19.45,11,20z M5.99,4.58c-0.39-0.39-1.03-0.39-1.41,0 c-0.39,0.39-0.39,1.03,0,1.41l1.06,1.06c0.39,0.39,1.03,0.39,1.41,0s0.39-1.03,0-1.41L5.99,4.58z M18.36,16.95 c-0.39-0.39-1.03-0.39-1.41,0c-0.39,0.39-0.39,1.03,0,1.41l1.06,1.06c0.39,0.39,1.03,0.39,1.41,0c0.39-0.39,0.39-1.03,0-1.41 L18.36,16.95z M19.42,5.99c0.39-0.39,0.39-1.03,0-1.41c-0.39-0.39-1.03-0.39-1.41,0l-1.06,1.06c-0.39,0.39-0.39,1.03,0,1.41 s1.03,0.39,1.41,0L19.42,5.99z M7.05,18.36c0.39-0.39,0.39-1.03,0-1.41c-0.39-0.39-1.03-0.39-1.41,0l-1.06,1.06 c-0.39,0.39-0.39,1.03,0,1.41s1.03,0.39,1.41,0L7.05,18.36z\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=24 height=24 aria-hidden=true class=\"toggleIcon_g3eP darkToggleIcon_wfgR\"><path fill=currentColor d=\"M9.37,5.51C9.19,6.15,9.1,6.82,9.1,7.5c0,4.08,3.32,7.4,7.4,7.4c0.68,0,1.35-0.09,1.99-0.27C17.45,17.19,14.93,19,12,19 c-3.86,0-7-3.14-7-7C5,9.07,6.81,6.55,9.37,5.51z M12,3c-4.97,0-9,4.03-9,9s4.03,9,9,9s9-4.03,9-9c0-0.46-0.04-0.92-0.1-1.36 c-0.98,1.37-2.58,2.26-4.4,2.26c-2.98,0-5.4-2.42-5.4-5.4c0-1.81,0.89-3.42,2.26-4.4C12.92,3.04,12.46,3,12,3L12,3z\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=24 height=24 aria-hidden=true class=\"toggleIcon_g3eP systemToggleIcon_QzmC\"><path fill=currentColor d=\"m12 21c4.971 0 9-4.029 9-9s-4.029-9-9-9-9 4.029-9 9 4.029 9 9 9zm4.95-13.95c1.313 1.313 2.05 3.093 2.05 4.95s-0.738 3.637-2.05 4.95c-1.313 1.313-3.093 2.05-4.95 2.05v-14c1.857 0 3.637 0.737 4.95 2.05z\"/></svg></button></div><div class=navbarSearchContainer_Bca1></div></div></div><div role=presentation class=navbar-sidebar__backdrop></div></nav><div id=__docusaurus_skipToContent_fallback class=\"theme-layout-main main-wrapper mainWrapper_z2l0\"><main class=main_iUjq><section class=hero_aEcG><p class=eyebrow>[ open-source \u00b7 self-hosted \u00b7 MIT ]<h1 class=heroTitle_qg2I>The <mark>open-source</mark> AI app builder \u2014 on your own server.</h1><p class=heroSub_yj39>Build an app from a prompt, or run any of 80+ open-source apps \u2014 each isolated, at its own live URL. Your infra, your code, your keys.<div class=paths_b05y><a class=\"button button--primary button--lg pathBtn_l6Zu\" href=/quickstart>\u26a1 Self-host \u2014 free & open source</a><a class=\"button button--lg pathBtn_l6Zu managedBtn_OZVJ\" href=/managed>Managed \u2014 we run it for you</a></div><div class=heroFoot_e93Y><code class=installLine_oTkK>curl -fsSL sandboxd.io/install | bash</code><a href=https://github.com/tastyeffectco/sandboxd target=_blank rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=ghostBtn_BuEF>\u2605 Star on GitHub</a></div></section><div class=head_QHiF style=margin-top:8px><p class=eyebrow>[ see it in action ]<h2 class=headTitle_ZeFu>Three ways to ship</h2></div><div class=carousel_qyqS><div class=tabs_e8iF role=tablist><button role=tab aria-selected=true class=tabOn_p5ll><span class=tabNo_OmgW>1</span> <!-- -->Build from a prompt</button><button role=tab aria-selected=false class=tab_g2r_><span class=tabNo_OmgW>2</span> <!-- -->Run an existing app</button><button role=tab aria-selected=false class=tab_g2r_><span class=tabNo_OmgW>3</span> <!-- -->Drive it from the API</button></div><p class=carBlurb_mEta>Describe an app; a coding agent builds it in an isolated sandbox and it appears at a live preview URL.<div class=demoFrame_od2x><img class=demoVideo_j698 src=/demo/create-app.gif alt=\"Create a blog from a prompt in the sandboxd console\" loading=eager style=display:block /><img class=demoVideo_j698 src=/demo/n8n.gif alt=\"Run an existing open-source app (n8n) in sandboxd\" loading=lazy style=display:none /><img class=demoVideo_j698 src=/demo/api.gif alt=\"Drive sandboxd from the API / CLI\" loading=lazy style=display:none /></div></div><div class=rule_vunh style=margin-top:36px></div><div class=head_QHiF><p class=eyebrow>[ what you get ]<h2 class=headTitle_ZeFu>The platform, distilled to one command</h2><p class=headSub_oZnK>Isolation, preview routing, idle/wake, agent orchestration \u2014 in one binary.</div><div class=features_cAfv><div class=feat_vcOH><div class=featNo_cfEw>01</div><h3>Isolated sandboxes</h3><p>One hardened container per user, agent, or branch.</div><div class=feat_vcOH><div class=featNo_cfEw>02</div><h3>No creds in the sandbox</h3><p>A proxy injects model keys on the wire; nothing secret lands in the workspace.</div><div class=feat_vcOH><div class=featNo_cfEw>03</div><h3>In-console code editor</h3><p>Browse, edit, save, see the diff \u2014 in the browser.</div><div class=feat_vcOH><div class=featNo_cfEw>04</div><h3>Git: diff, commit, push</h3><p>Review file-by-file and ship from the console.</div><div class=feat_vcOH><div class=featNo_cfEw>05</div><h3>Undo any task</h3><p>Every task is checkpointed first; revert in one click.</div><div class=feat_vcOH><div class=featNo_cfEw>06</div><h3>Live preview URLs</h3><p>Every app at its own link. Idle sandboxes sleep; the next request wakes them.</div><div class=feat_vcOH><div class=featNo_cfEw>07</div><h3>One-command install</h3><p>curl \u2026 | bash. Just Docker \u2014 no Kubernetes, no database server.</div><div class=feat_vcOH><div class=featNo_cfEw>08</div><h3>Yours, MIT-licensed</h3><p>Self-hosted, open-source, no lock-in.</div><div class=feat_vcOH><div class=featNo_cfEw>09</div><h3>Starts with no API key</h3><p>OpenCode runs on a free tier out of the box; add your own key for more models.</div></div><div class=rule_vunh style=margin-top:32px></div><div class=head_QHiF><p class=eyebrow>[ the console ]<h2 class=headTitle_ZeFu>Drive it all from a browser</h2><p class=headSub_oZnK>The optional console is a pure API client: chat, edit, review, roll back.</div><div class=showcase_LKp3><div class=panel_aLk8><div class=panelBar_NfPp><span class=dot_K917></span>Agent \u00b7 chat + revert</div><div class=panelBody_Q075><div class=bubbleUser_cnrh>build a todo app on port 3000</div><div class=bubbleAgent_vmXR>Added <code>App.tsx</code>, wired the list, started Vite on :3000. \u2713</div><div class=turnFoot_ojFn><span class=ok__33F>succeeded</span><span>3 files</span><span class=revert_qHCY>\u21a9 revert</span></div></div><div class=caption_xdES>Chat, watch it stream, and undo any turn.<!-- --> <a href=/guides/tasks>Tasks & revert<!-- --> \u2192</a></div></div><div class=panel_aLk8><div class=panelBar_NfPp><span class=dot_K917></span>Files \u00b7 editor + diff</div><div class=panelBody_Q075><div class=tree_RiLN><div class=dir>\u25be src</div><div class=tree_RiLN><span class=sel_RWxW>App.tsx</span><span class=badge__JoJ>M</span></div><div class=file>main.tsx</div><div class=file>index.css <span class=badge__JoJ>+</span></div><div class=dir>package.json</div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px;border-top:1px solid var(--sbx-border);padding-top:8px\"><div class=codeLine_zf6H>1  export default function App() <!-- -->{</div><div class=\"codeLine_zf6H plus_A1P_\">2  +  const [items, set] = useState([])</div><div class=codeLine_zf6H>3     return &lt;ul>\u2026</div></div></div><div class=caption_xdES>Browse the tree, edit inline, see git status.<!-- --> <a href=/guides/console>Files & git<!-- --> \u2192</a></div></div><div class=panel_aLk8><div class=panelBar_NfPp><span class=dot_K917></span>Git \u00b7 diff + push</div><div class=panelBody_Q075><div style=font-size:0.7rem;margin-bottom:6px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;opacity:0.7>branch main \u00b7 \u21911</div><div class=codeLine_zf6H>  @@ src/App.tsx @@</div><div class=\"codeLine_zf6H diffDel_W9SH\">- &lt;h1>Hi&lt;/h1></div><div class=\"codeLine_zf6H diffAdd_CnnO\">+ &lt;TodoList /></div><div class=commitBtn_lqib>commit (2) \u00b7 push \u2191</div></div><div class=caption_xdES>Review, commit, and push \u2014 no context switch.<!-- --> <a href=/guides/console>Git tab<!-- --> \u2192</a></div></div></div><div class=rule_vunh style=margin-top:40px></div><div class=head_QHiF><p class=eyebrow>[ architecture ]<h2 class=headTitle_ZeFu>Boring on purpose</h2><p class=headSub_oZnK>One Go binary drives Docker. Traefik routes, SQLite is the source of truth, a reconciler converges on boot.</div><div class=arch_awra><div class=archBox_Wed8>        \u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 your host (just needs Docker) \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510\nbrowser \u2500\u25b6\u2502 traefik \u2500\u25b6 sandbox  (coding agent + dev server :3000)   \u2502\nAPI/CLI \u2500\u25b6\u2502 sandboxd \u2500\u2500\u2500 auth proxy (keys never enter the sandbox)   \u2502\n        \u2502    \u2502   SQLite (source of truth) \u00b7 idle\u2192sleep \u00b7 req\u2192wake   \u2502\n        \u2502    \u2514\u2500\u2500 workspace dir (persists) \u00b7 per-task checkpoints     \u2502\n        \u2514\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518</div><div style=margin-top:14px;display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap><a class=ghostBtn_BuEF href=/reference/architecture>How it works \u2192</a><a class=ghostBtn_BuEF href=/security>Security & isolation \u2192</a></div></div><div class=head_QHiF><p class=eyebrow>[ three ways to run it ]<h2 class=headTitle_ZeFu>Self-host, or let us run it</h2><p class=headSub_oZnK>Same open-source sandboxd underneath.</div><div class=features_cAfv style=margin-bottom:8px><div class=feat_vcOH><div class=featNo_cfEw>free</div><h3>Self-host</h3><p>MIT, one command, your box. Free forever.<br/><a href=/quickstart>Quickstart \u2192</a></div><div class=feat_vcOH><div class=featNo_cfEw>$79/mo</div><h3>Managed</h3><p>We run sandboxd <b>on your server</b>: upgrades, tuning, support.<br/><a href=/managed>See Managed \u2192</a></div><div class=feat_vcOH><div class=featNo_cfEw>$4.99/mo</div><h3>Cloud</h3><p><b>https://you.sandboxd.io</b> for your own server, in one command. No DNS, no ports, works behind NAT.<br/><a href=/cloud>See Cloud \u2192</a> \u00b7 <a href=https://cloud.sandboxd.io/>Get started \u2192</a></div></div><section class=section_Q9Zo><div class=cta__fRr><p class=eyebrow style=text-align:center>[ get started ]<h2>Free & MIT. Self-host it in one command.</h2><p>First app with no API key, on the OpenCode free tier.<div class=ctaBtns_w_00><a class=\"button button--primary\" href=/quickstart>Quickstart</a><a href=https://cloud.sandboxd.io/ target=_blank rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=ghostBtn_BuEF>Get a public URL \u2014 Cloud</a><a href=https://github.com/sponsors/tastyeffectco target=_blank rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=ghostBtn_BuEF>\u2764 Sponsor</a><a href=https://github.com/tastyeffectco/sandboxd target=_blank rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=ghostBtn_BuEF>Star on GitHub</a></div></div></section></main></div><footer class=\"theme-layout-footer footer footer--dark\"><div class=\"container container-fluid\"><div class=\"row footer__links\"><div class=\"theme-layout-footer-column col footer__col\"><div class=footer__title>[ DOCS ]</div><ul class=\"footer__items clean-list\"><li class=footer__item><a class=footer__link-item href=/what-is-sandboxd>What is sandboxd?</a><li class=footer__item><a class=footer__link-item href=/quickstart>Quickstart</a><li class=footer__item><a class=footer__link-item href=/cloud>sandboxd Cloud</a><li class=footer__item><a class=footer__link-item href=/guides/pc-as-server>Your PC/Mac as the server</a><li class=footer__item><a class=footer__link-item href=/roadmap>Roadmap</a><li class=footer__item><a class=footer__link-item href=/reference/api>API reference</a><li class=footer__item><a class=footer__link-item href=/reference/architecture>Architecture</a></ul></div><div class=\"theme-layout-